{"product":{"id":8597390590291,"title":"DAVINES PASTA\u0026LOVE HAIR, BEARD \u0026 BODY WASH","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePASTA\u0026amp;LOVE HAIR, BEARD \u0026amp; BODY WASH BY DAVINES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Men's multi-purpose cleansing product formulated to wash hair, beard and body. It is enriched with Alkekenghi, rich in antioxidants and contributes to promote a delicate cleansing with a distinctive citrusy scent. Provides hydration leaving the skin soft. Suitable also to cleanse the beard and moustache prior to shaving.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion__text container\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifics\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifics__wrapper\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifics__item\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifics__list\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGently and effectively cleanses hair, body and beard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eProvides hydration and leaves skin soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eClean and distinctive fragrance, leaving the skin gently scented\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eApply to wet hair, beard and body. Gently massage. Rinse thoroughly. Rinse thoroughly in case of contact with eyes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"hair beard body wash","created_at":"2023-11-12T15:46:11+02:00","handle":"davines-hair-beard-body-wash","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:20+03:00","published_at":"2023-11-12T15:46:11+02:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tag